This project uses open source dependencies. No Alfa-Bank source, brand assets, photographs, or official scoring rules are included. Independent demo UI, no affiliation implied.

Models, datasets and services in the delivered runtime:
No LLM, ML model, external dataset, paid API or corporate service is used.
Demo companies, users, financial data and applications are generated by seed_demo. They are synthetic and not derived from real customers.
Simulated integrations: FNS (company activity, age, tax debt) and BKI (credit score, overdue days). Both are local deterministic adapters reading synthetic Company records and storing revisioned VerificationResult records. They do not contact FNS, BKI, Alfa-Bank or other external systems. Credit signature and disbursement are not performed; COMPLETED models the end of the demo process only.
Reference material: the hackathon case supplied by the user and https://alfabank.ru/ as a visual reference. Neither the case PDF nor website assets are redistributed.

